node_modules
.next
.git
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
# Local env overrides — inside Docker we use docker-compose `environment:`
# instead. If `.env.local` ends up in the image it pins NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL
# to localhost:8000, which inside the frontend container resolves to the
# frontend itself and breaks the /api proxy to the backend.
.env*
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.DS_Store
e2e
playwright.config.ts
test-results
playwright-report

# AI dev artifacts — never ship to production (MEH-449)
# Canonical pattern list: ../.claude/hooks/check-artifact-location.sh
# Explicit names only — no *.md blanket glob (README.md must stay shippable).
# **/ prefix covers nested copies (e.g. e2e/CLAUDE.md) as well as root-level.
**/.aider.conf.yml
**/.claude
**/.cursor
**/AGENTS.md
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md
**/CLAUDE.md
**/HANDOFF.md
**/ROADMAP.md
docs/DEPLOYMENT.md
docs/MANUAL_TESTING.md
docs/MIGRATIONS.md
docs/SECURITY.md
